  "cooked": "<p>As comparision, in ASNs classified as \u201chosting\u201d, there wasn\u2019t a big change in reachable node counts. There just happened to be a spike in reachable nodes around the Bitcoin Core v30.0 release. Note that the Bitnodes data does not contain any bitprojects \u201cnodes\u201d (<a href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/t/many-connections-to-bitproject-io-nodes/40\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Many connections to bitproject.io nodes?</a>).</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/8db7cde616b1704c1cb8faf65c4183e6616616bc.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/8db7cde616b1704c1cb8faf65c4183e6616616bc\" title=\"Change in hosted node count since Bitcoin Core v30.0 release (580 hosted ASNs; bitnodes data)\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8db7cde616b1704c1cb8faf65c4183e6616616bc_2_690x342.png\" alt=\"Change in hosted node count since Bitcoin Core v30.0 release (580 hosted ASNs; bitnodes data)\" data-base62-sha1=\"kdH7zMMweDUDlcvgBXaZhA3If5W\" width=\"690\" height=\"342\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8db7cde616b1704c1cb8faf65c4183e6616616bc_2_690x342.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8db7cde616b1704c1cb8faf65c4183e6616616bc_2_1035x513.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8db7cde616b1704c1cb8faf65c4183e6616616bc_2_1380x684.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Change in hosted node count since Bitcoin Core v30.0 release (580 hosted ASNs; bitnodes data)</span><span class=\"informations\">1390\u00d7690 82.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In total, there a more reachable nodes in ASNs classified as \u201cresidential\u201d than \u201chosting\u201d:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/562a354df8c098d9a47b6c4339f39d8a78f77a0f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/562a354df8c098d9a47b6c4339f39d8a78f77a0f\" title=\"Total node count across 'hosting' and 'residential' ASNs (Bitnodes data)\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/562a354df8c098d9a47b6c4339f39d8a78f77a0f_2_690x355.png\" alt=\"Total node count across 'hosting' and 'residential' ASNs (Bitnodes data)\" data-base62-sha1=\"cifuzGEOLqS51iY9fyyR9KwG39B\" width=\"690\" height=\"355\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/562a354df8c098d9a47b6c4339f39d8a78f77a0f_2_690x355.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/562a354df8c098d9a47b6c4339f39d8a78f77a0f_2_1035x532.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/562a354df8c098d9a47b6c4339f39d8a78f77a0f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Total node count across 'hosting' and 'residential' ASNs (Bitnodes data)</span><span class=\"informations\">1169\u00d7603 69.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
